===Etymology===
From a shortening of {{bor|en|la-med|mappa mundī}}, compound of {{der|en|la|mappa|t=napkin, cloth}} and {{m|la|mundus|t=world}}, ultimately of {{der|en|xpu|-}} origin. Replaced {{der|en|enm|mappemounde}}, {{m|enm|mapemounde|t=world map}}, from {{der|en|fro|mapamonde}}. See {{m|en|mop}} for more on the first component. {{doublet|en|mop|nape|id2=tablecloth|nappe}}.

